WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.370
When the Safavid state
fell apart in 1722,

2
00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:10.757
Ottoman armies marched east
to seize Persia's Caucasian lands.

3
00:00:10.797 --> 00:00:14.724
In Syunik, the Armenians
rose under Davit Bek.

4
00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:16.834
He made the fortress of Halidzor,

5
00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:21.077
on a ridge above the Voghji River,
his headquarters.

6
00:00:21.437 --> 00:00:24.287
In the late winter of 1727,

7
00:00:24.327 --> 00:00:27.401
a large Ottoman army
closed around it.

8
00:00:27.441 --> 00:00:30.110
The defenders
were badly outnumbered.

9
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.540
A secret tunnel
ran down to the river,

10
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.459
and it is said
to have kept them in water.

11
00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:39.869
As food ran low, Davit Bek
led the garrison down the hill

12
00:00:39.909 --> 00:00:41.189
in a sudden sortie,

13
00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:44.426
and the besieging army
broke and fled.

14
00:00:44.466 --> 00:00:47.676
His men drove the Ottomans
from Ghapan,

15
00:00:47.716 --> 00:00:51.197
and the shah recognized him
as ruler of the district.

16
00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:56.465
Man the walls, watch the tunnel,
and charge with Davit Bek.

